              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Balcaam wuxuu Baalaaq ku yidhi, Halkan iiga dhis toddoba meelood oo allabari, oo halkan iigu soo diyaari toddoba dibi iyo toddoba wan. ",
          "type": "text",
